  greetings:
  - H-help you find something?
  - Oh. Evening. W-we close at nine.
  aboutSelf: Run the store for my daddy. He was the town doctor. Retired now. M-mostly he sits by the window.
  aboutTown: Folks here don't like strangers looking too close. No offense, Detective.
  seenAnythingStrange: Somebody bought every mirror off my rack in one night. Money was just sitting on the counter in the morning. Exact change.
  foundersDay: Rained. Mae won the pie contest. Cherry. She always wins.
  gossip:
  - title: About Greta Kessler
    response: Greta's cows keep dying. She buries them herself now. Won't let the vet near the bodies.
  - title: About Wendell Dobbs
    response: Wendell Dobbs ain't been to town since spring. He leaves a grocery list in his mailbox and I leave the box at his gate.
